{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は夜ご飯をらりんと\n食べに行ってきたよ〜٩꒰৹৺৹ઌ꒱♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"またまたらーめん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや...これは麺類と言うべきか..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つけ麺を食べてきましたっ！\n淡々つけ麺♡♡♡"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/05/01/5627559/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んーこれ美味しいの顔？笑い"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーまたらーめん食べたい♡\nあたしは絶対に豚骨味なの。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いやいや！この話もしたかったの\nあのねあたしの大好きな\n『ダンガンロンパ』が舞台化に\nなるそうなんです(ु*´З`)ू❣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"10/29〜11/3 日本青年館 大ホール\nでやるらしいですっ♡♡♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ううぅ、これは本当に見に行きたい！\nむしろ、本当に本当に願いが\n叶うならば出演したい。泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当に何の役でもいいんです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"とか、TVの前に並べてある\n『ダンガンロンパ』のフィギュアを\nじーーーーと眺めながら日々\n思うのですっ(❁´ω`❁)*✲ﾟ*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2014/05/01/5627559/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"論破してやる〜っ\n『それは違うよっ！』"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"}